Daily Quests.text:
{{Stub}}
[[File:NewUI Currency Favor.png|right|link=]]

The '''Daily Quests''' system in [[Hand of the Gods: SMITE Tactics]] allows players to earn bonus {{Favor}} [[Favor]] by completing certain tasks each day. Players receive one new quest each day, and can have up to a maximum of three quests at a time. Players can re-roll one of their quests for a different one once per week. Quests can't usually be completed in friendly battles.

===List of daily quests===
*'''Chinese Conquest:''' Win 2 Games While Playing As The Chinese Pantheon. - 150 {{Favor}}
*'''Egyptian Conquest:''' Win 2 Games While Playing As Egyptian. - 150 {{Favor}}
*'''Greek Victory:''' Win 2 Games While Playing As Greek. - 150 {{Favor}}
*'''Norse Loving:''' Win 2 Games While Playing As Norse. - 150 {{Favor}}
*'''The All Nighter:''' Play 8 Games - 210 {{Favor}}
*'''Divine Power:''' Play 60 Gods - 210 {{Favor}}
*'''Mend the Heavens:''' Play 30 Chinese Gods - 150 {{Favor}}
*'''Roma Invicta!:''' Play 30 Roman Gods - 150 {{Favor}}

=== How to re-roll quests ===
[[File:Mend the Heavens.PNG|100px|thumb|right|The re-roll button appears on the upper right corner of the quest card.]]
